WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Find eligible analyses
Upload a file on Start to see analyses supported by your data. Begin with your question rather than a tool name.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Columns are not the whole contract
Tools need different row counts, periods and observation units. Check their required inputs and reasons for insufficient data.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Separate change from cause
Read the period, denominator and limitations. A before-and-after change alone does not prove advertising caused it.

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
A withheld conclusion needs evidence
For experiments and incrementality, check assignment and simultaneous changes. Unmet conditions call for more evidence, not a claim of no effect.
